{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "That motherfucker! What kind of monster goes around showing poor girls his pecker!": "",
  "Reminds me of that time me and Tsukino accidentally saw our father's, and he was—": "",
  "H-Hey, let's not, Yosuke!": "",
  "I take it he's earned the name, \"Giant Impact,\" right?": "",
  "Yeah, he's a fresh face on the pervert scene. Somehow it figures that he'd find Tsukino of all people...": "",
  "I guess an exhibitionist was bound to be next on the list...": "",
  "Yeah, lots of rumors about this guy lately. People are too embarrassed to say his name though, so they call him \"G.I.\"": "",
  "But I'm curious... Was he really that big, Tsukino?": "",
  "Would you say he was bigger or smaller than Dad?": "",
  "Wait, I don't want to think about it! Don't be gross, Yosuke!": "",
  "How notorious is this guy at this point? Is he on par with the Twisted Trio?": "",
  "Sort of. People seem to think he was their leader. That's why he called himself the Exhibitionist Emperor.": "",
  "Exhibitionist Emperor? Come on...": "",
  "Word on the street is that he's really massive down there, so he's developed kind of a fanbase of would-be pervs...": "",
  "I guess you'd have to be pretty big to call yourself an emperor...": "",
  "Yagami-san... You're not going to let this monster keep whipping his thing out in public, are you?": "",
  "I guess not, but...": "",
  "Then it's settled! I'll even fund you on this! The usual 50,000 yen!": "",
  "You have to avenge Tsukino's innocence!": "",
  "All right. I'm on the case.": "",
  "Great! But... Any ideas how you'll catch this one?": "",
  "Let's see...": "",
  "We'll need to try to predict where he's going to show himself next.": "",
  "You seem to have this guy's number, Yosuke. Any idea where he's been?": "",
  "Naturally.": "",
  "My poor sister is a pervert magnet, so I have to stay up to date on this nonsense!": "",
  "What is it about me that draws every pervert in the city in my direction...": "",
  "Anyway, I'd say the largest concentration of sightings were on Shichifuku Street and Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "That's where the Panty Professor and Ass Catchem were active too.": "",
  "In fact, I think those turfs opening up is what gave G.I. his in.": "",
  "They have turfs?": "",
  "Yeah. Apparently the Twisted Trio hated when other perverts would try to muscle in on their territories.": "",
  "Why do perverts have a social ecology...?": "",
  "But if his \"exhibitions\" can be traced, why hasn't he been caught yet?": "",
  "That's the thing. It seems he moves on once he's caused enough of a commotion in one area.": "",
  "I see. I guess he's pretty cautious, despite his appearance.": "",
  "Hmm. If we can analyze his pattern, we might be able to figure out where he'll go next...": "",
  "Great idea. Let's put our thinking caps on.": "",
  "How about here?": "",
  "This was the area the Panty Professor worked in.": "",
  "There are already reports of him appearing there, so that's probably out.": "",
  "(So G.I. has already exhausted his time on the Panty Professor's turf...)": "",
  "(Then the next likely place would be...)": "",
  "Ugh. Oh no...": "",
  "My butt! There are phantom hands on my ass!": "",
  "Yosuke?": "",
  "Yagami-san... That's the place my brother was groped.": "",
  "Even now, when I think about it, I can still feel his hand clenched around my tender cheeks...": "",
  "It sends a shiver up my spine... Or down my butt... It's bad either way.": "",
  "I'm sorry. It sounds like you're pretty traumatized.": "",
  "Anyway, G.I. has been spotted in that area, so he probably won't pop up again there.": "",
  "(So G.I. has already exhausted his time on Ass Catchem's turf...)": "",
  "The Hotel District?": "",
  "Yes, G.I. is taking advantage of the Twisted Trio's empty turf, which means...": "",
  "Judge Creep 'n Peep's old stomping ground is ripe for the taking right now.": "",
  "You're really smart, Yagami-san!": "",
  "I guess I'll stake out the Hotel District for a few, and see what I find.": "",
  "Thank you! I'll look forward to the report!": "",
  "(If G.I. is as cautious as I suspect he is, he'll be on high alert, even though this area is primed for him.)": "",
  "(He'd probably try to hide his features... So I need to look carefully for features he can't conceal.)": "",
  "(Hm, that guy's bald, but...)": "",
  "(Sunglasses and a mask... Talk about suspicious. Not to mention how he's ogling these women.) ": "",
  "(I'll follow him for a few.)": "",
  "(No. He doesn't match the profile. This isn't the guy...)": "",
  "Eeeeeek!": "",
  "It's you. Have you come to bask in the shadow of my scrotum totem?": "",
  "Your what!?": "",
  "Ahh!": "",
  "Is that a... leaf?": "",
  "Hahaha. You are not welcome around my son. The Exhibitionism Emperor's gates do not open for men.": "",
  "...Farewell.": "",
  "Tch!": "",
  "I have you cornered. Time to give up.": "",
  "Why so shocked? Surprised to discover that Giant Impact is such an old man?": "",
  "Imagine having a body like this at 78! And a son so magnificent! Are you not in awe!?": "",
  "78? No way...": "",
  "You are all but hairless, swaddled babes before me and my man root! Now, face the power of 78 years of perversion!": "",
  "Perpetual perversion! Ceaseless creeping! I, Shinzaburo Ishikawa, am your opponent!": "",
  "...Ggh! So it's true that you're the one who defeated the Twisted Trio!? And now I too, have fallen!": "",
  "Just tell me why. Why would you go around exposing yourself like that?": "",
  "...Very well. You defeated me. You've earned an explanation.": "",
  "To tell the truth...": "",
  "What! Seriously?": "",
  "Yes. Even at this age, I am as celibate as a child. My massive phallus has never known another's pleasure.": "",
  "I tried everything to win the favor of the ladies. I sculpted the body you see before you.": "",
  "But it was no use. I began to despair...": "",
  "It was tragic irony. How could I die before utilizing such massive meat? It was too much to bear.": "",
  "So... I loosed my son upon the world.": "",
  "I-I see... Except not really. I can't even begin to understand that logic.": "",
  "...Hmph. The shrieking of those women... That was the only way my son felt alive.": "",
  "But... all things must end. My regrets are many, and yet they hardly matter now...": "",
  "Whoa! H-Hey!": "",
  "Zzzzzzzz...": "",
  "Oh. I guess the fight took a lot out of him...": "",
  "So G.I. was actually 78 years old...": "",
  "I guess all that pent-up testosterone finally cracked him at that age...": "",
  "I almost feel bad for him. 78 years of isolation... Who wouldn't become a monster?": "",
  "If he'd found love, maybe things would have been different for him.": "",
  "Hey, let's not turn this into a pity party for a pervert.": "",
  "Well, you know where to find me if any more perverts come out of the woodwork.": "",
  "Although I'd say we've done our fair share in that department...": "",
  "Yes. Thank you so much, Yagami-san!": "",
  "(We're moving away from Tsukino-san's scream!)": "",
  "Are you all right!? Did he hurt you!?": "",
  "I'm actually... a virgin.": "",
  "(All right. I have a good view of the Hotel District here.)": "",
  "(Okay. Now to wait for our guy.)": "",
  "(This is where the client told me to meet him...)": "",
  "Detective Yagami?": "",
  "Are you my client?": "",
  "Yeah. You can call me \"Crow.\"": "",
  "That mask... Are you in that group of thieves everyone's been whispering about lately?": "",
  "Why, you wouldn't snitch if I was, would you?": "",
  "We may be thieves, but we don't steal from the righteous. Just the bad guys. You know, like Robin Hood.": "",
  "And because they're bad, it's not a crime? That's for a judge to decide, not me.": "",
  "Really? You're more of a goody-two-shoes than I thought.": "",
  "(The barkeep at Tender told me this was a request from one of his regulars...)": "",
  "(But he knew I'd turn down a request from a thief, so he lied to me... Damn, that's cold.)": "",
  "Here's the thing. I protect my clients' privacy, so you can rest easy about that.": "",
  "But if you're trying to get me to help you steal something... I'm not accepting your case.": "",
  "Okay, that suits me fine, because all I want you to do is find someone.": "",
  "Find someone?": "",
  "He goes by \"Jester.\" I don't know his real name.": "",
  "So he's...": "",
  "Yes, he's one of ours. But I haven't been able to reach him for a while.": "",
  "I think it's safe to say he's missing in action.": "",
  "You know what he looks like?": "",
  "As his name suggests, he wears a jester's mask.": "",
  "Oh really?": "",
  "(I know exactly who that is...)": "",
  "One of our guys screwed the pooch, and we ended up needing to run from the cops.": "",
  "We only managed to get away because Jester distracted them.": "",
  "Hm. Sounds like a helluva friend.": "",
  "That's when we lost touch with him, though.": "",
  "But he's way too good to get captured. And that's what makes his silence all the more perplexing.": "",
  "Sounds like you have a lot of faith in him.": "",
  "He's our ace in the hole. He's smart, professional, and really good.": "",
  "So if he's in trouble, we need to be there for him this time.": "",
  "I'll pay you 50,000 yen! And don't worry, it's clean money!": "",
  "(I was curious about that guy myself... If I take this job, maybe we'll cross paths again.)": "",
  "All right. I'll accept the case.": "",
  "Then it's a done deal! We'll be expecting results.": "",
  "Wait. How should I get in touch with you if I find anything?": "",
  "Come back here when you find something out. We always have someone watching this spot.": "",
  "We'll know when you come, Yagami-san.": "",
  "So long, then.": "",
  "(I'm helping a group of notorious thieves find their buddy... What is life, if not an adventure...)": "",
  "(Where do I even begin?)": "",
  "(I guess it wouldn't hurt to check out the spot where I saw him last.)": "",
  "(If I recall, that was the building behind Tenkaichi Street. Let's move.)": "",
  "(This is where the thief helped me out...)": "",
  "(Nothing seems out of the ordinary, though.)": "",
  "(Wait... Isn't that him!?)": "",
  "Are you here on the trail of certain... thieves? I'm a huge fan!": "",
  "Huh? You're a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>fan</font_kind>?": "",
  "Yeah! I'm a major thief aficionado! ": "",
  "When I heard they'd been spotted here, I totally had to come down and check it out!": "",
  "Wait, so... You're not a member yourself?": "",
  "Haha, nah. But I look the part, right? You wouldn't believe what I went through to get this stuff.": "",
  "Yeah, but why?": "",
  "Because! Just check out these silver accessories, man. 500,000 yen, when all was said and done!": "",
  "You're kidding me, right!? What's even the point of wearing that much bling?": "",
  "Well, the ones that the thieves wear cost like, a few more 0's...": "",
  "But you can't fault a guy for wanting to dress like his heroes, can you?": "",
  "Oh, so these thieves have a style? I guess even thieves need to make a fashion statement...": "",
  "It's more of a recent thing. They used to be pretty generic.": "",
  "But now they wear really high end brands. When you get as good as them, I guess you can afford it!": "",
  "So I see...": "",
  "(The fee they offered was pretty generous, so I could already tell they weren't broke...)": "",
  "Sorry man, can I ask you to snap a pic of me? I gotta post it to my Chatter!": "",
  "Uh, I'm a little busy for that. Sorry.": "",
  "(Well, this was a dead end. Maybe I should try Senryo Avenue.)": "",
  "Hey! Stop right there!": "",
  "(What's going on...?)": "",
  "Okay, meet up at the Kamuro Theater garden rooftop!": "",
  "*huff* *huff* H-Hold it...!": "",
  "(Weren't those two in the same group of thieves?)": "",
  "Did those guys just steal something, officer?": "",
  "Yeah! Some poor woman's handbag!": "",
  "Really? Weren't they those thieves everyone's talking about lately? I thought they only stole from the unjust.": "",
  "That's a bald-faced lie! Nothing but propaganda!": "",
  "As you can tell, they're out here stealing whatever they can get their grubby mitts on, \"just\" or not!": "",
  "(This doesn't add up...)": "",
  "(Those guys said something about meeting at Kamuro Theater... Maybe I can catch up to them.)": "",
  "(This is where those two purse snatchers were going to meet up...)": "",
  "(Those clothes... Is that them?)": "",
  "Whew, close one.": "",
  "I told you this was a bad move, man. We're just robbers now.": "",
  "I thought we were only gonna steal from the wicked? Isn't that Crow's whole philosophy?": "",
  "Maybe it was... But that hypocrite doesn't practice what he preaches, so why should we?": "",
  "(What...?)": "",
  "That's what I read on the net too... But it's really true?": "",
  "Well, here's what I heard, man.": "",
  "Basically, he got offered a job by some big corporation to steal secrets from their competition.": "",
  "The money they offered was so good, the senior members knew they couldn't turn it down.": "",
  "So they took it and then split the profits. And none of it even made it down to grunts like us.": "",
  "What about Jester? He would never do that... Would he?": "",
  "No way. Jester's not like that.": "",
  "So what they told us about how he quit over the profit splitting... Think that's true?": "",
  "No way, man. He didn't like how Crow was running the show, so he split.": "",
  "Damn, dude...": "",
  "But I still say Jester's an idiot, too.": "",
  "Just because you claim you're a righteous thief doesn't mean you're not gonna do time if the cops catch you.": "",
  "So what's the point? May as well try to come out ahead.": "",
  "I guess, but... You think the rest of the crew knows all this?": "",
  "I doubt the newbies do.": "",
  "They all bought into Crow's lies and they probably think Jester's actually \"missing.\"": "",
  "So I say we keep getting better, and hope Crow cuts us in on the next big job.": "",
  "Good a plan as any, right?": "",
  "Wait a sec...!": "",
  "...Fuck it. I can't do this anymore. I'm gonna quit. Maybe I should just turn myself in...": "",
  "(Well, shit. Sounds like this client's been trying to play me.)": "",
  "(Jester isn't \"missing,\" he just quit because his group got hijacked by this Crow guy.)": "",
  "(And if I had to guess Crow's motivation for looking for Jester... Well, it couldn't be good.)": "",
  "(I think me and my client need to have a discussion.)": "",
  "Who the hell are you? You trying to impersonate Jester with that mask?": "",
  "You aren't him! You tryin' to pull a fast one on us, dumbass!?": "",
  "E-Eek! I'm sorry!": "",
  "Besides, Jester never wore all this loud, tacky shit.": "",
  "So here's a good plan... Why don't we take it off your hands? Then you'll really look the part! Hahaha!": "",
  "(Those guys... What are they doing!?)": "",
  "Hey, stop!": "",
  "Aren't you... that weird thieves fan?": "",
  "Y-Yes...?": "",
  "I saw the thieves, and I wanted to shake their hands, but then they kinda...": "",
  "Yagami-san... You came at a bad time.": "",
  "Crow... What's going on here?": "",
  "A little slip up. More importantly, did you find Jester?": "",
  "I'm disappointed. For a detective with a reputation for proving a murder suspect innocent, you're not that impressive.": "",
  "I could say the same of you. Righteous thieves? What a joke.": "",
  "And your \"missing\" friend? That's all a lie too, right?": "",
  "You're coming on pretty strong there, Yagami. Why would you ever think that?": "",
  "I think there's plenty of evidence.": "",
  "The way I hear it, you broke the rule about only stealing from the corrupt.": "",
  "Huh? What are you talking about?": "",
  "The job was too good to pass up, wasn't it? You couldn't resist.": "",
  "You're talking out your ass. I don't keep any of the money I steal.": "",
  "It seems stupid to even have to point this out, but...": "",
  "That crap you're wearing? I heard it's expensive. And how many do you even have? More than I could afford.": "",
  "Haha, now we're seeing the detective come out. You have a good eye.": "",
  "So tell me, why are you really looking for Jester?": "",
  "No reason, really. Just had a pretty tempting job to offer him.": "",
  "We're going to rob the security van of a credit union. And the best part? The client is the credit union's manager.": "",
  "They need a robbery to happen to cover up their financial failure. A classic insurance fraud.": "",
  "They get reimbursed by their insurance, and they expect us to give back what we steal, doubling their profits.": "",
  "But I have no intention of giving it back. People are such idiots when they're backed into a corner!": "",
  "So you're staging a robbery and then breaching your contract... What happened to honor among thieves?": "",
  "That's how it was... at first.": "",
  "We used to talk big on back channel net chats, but we'd always chicken out when it came to pulling the heist.": "",
  "We were all talk. Just a bunch of losers on the web. Until he showed up.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Let's see...": "อืม ขอคิดดูก่อน...",
  "Naturally.": "แน่นอนอยู่แล้ว",
  "Ahh!": "อ๊าก!",
  "...Farewell.": "...ลาก่อน.",
  "Tch!": "เชอะ!",
  "Oh really?": "อ้อ จริงเหรอ",
  "Hey, stop!": "นี่ หยุดนะ!",
  "Huh? What are you talking about?": "หา? พูดเรื่องอะไรกัน?"
 }
}
